msgid ""
"To see this code in action, let’s modify `main` to accept only two requests "
"before gracefully shutting down the server, as shown in Listing 21-25."
msgstr ""
"为了观察这段代码的实际操作，我们修改“main”，改为在优雅地关闭服务器前只接受两"
"个请求，如列表 21-25 所示。"

